<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The archive. Material's outlined folder — a tab on the top-left and a body — drawn to the same
  spec as the other tool icons: white on transparent, 24dp, 2dp round-join strokes. Until v3.5.0
  the archive button borrowed the SDK's DELETE glyph (an X in a circle), and people read it as
  "delete", which is exactly the thing archiving is not. A folder says "put away, still here."
-->
